<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 38-3 V AUSTRALIA, SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 38-3 V AUSTRALIA, SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 38 for three at the close on the second day of the second test against Australia at Lord's on Friday.</p>
<p>Rain prevented any further play after the lunch interval.</p>
<p>Thursday's scheduled opening day was washed out without a ball being bowled.</p>
<p>England lead 1-0 in the six-match series.</p>
